   "about": "Do RouteIQ receiving hours match practice? (the 13 Oct analysis, 'Claims check' WINDOW_WRONG).",
   "branches": 42,
   "summary": "Of 27 RouteIQ rows with a hard window and 3+ corroborated visits, 12 regularly finish after the close (at least 25% of visits and at least 2) and were still received; RouteIQ plans unloading to FINISH by hard_to (owner rule 29 Sep 2026), so it would not plan those slots. Under an arrival-only rule 5 are narrower than practice. 15 are consistent. 15 rows have no confirmed hours; their observed practice is given. No row suggests an earlier opening. This is practice, not the store rule: no customer-level list from sales was in the inputs, and every window must be confirmed with the customer.",
